WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Music: The Way I Do - Bishop Briggs

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.020
- If we wanna turn this place right

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.480
We have to speak as one united group.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.260
- Who's in?

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.620
- Are you insane!?
- No she's angry!

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.380
- We're all angry.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.080
- You done a girl wrong Mr Caputo,

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.940
and we want justice.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.640
- To whom it may concern,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.980
We the inmates of Lichfield,
are human beings.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.660
We are protesting the abusive conditions
under which we are being held.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.460
- We're gonna give 'em a show

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.220
- Whooo!

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.020
- We're gonna be super famous!

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.500
- Don't forget to smile.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.160
- Do you get what's going on here?

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.100
- We get beat for no reason,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.620
- we're stuffed four in a bunk like we factory chicken,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.820
- We're denied basic humanity.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.960
- How can I help?

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.260
- People ain't gonna like you.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.200
- Story of my life.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:03.480
- You do what you gotta do,
you don't owe nothing to no one

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.860
- My god!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.680
- We have the chance to rule hard up in here.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.720
- Y'all don't wanna rule?

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.620
- You see a problem, you deal with it

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.580
- This IS my home and I'm gonna fight for it.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.620
(Screaming)

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.140
- We get to make demands.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.000
- No idea is a bad idea.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.120
- Ice cream sundee bar!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.120
- Latin class!

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:22.620
- An anti gravity chamber,
we could float around and do
flips and stuff.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.760
- Ok! some ideas ARE bad ideas!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.600
- Tell this woman what we want.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.360
We wanna be motherf***in taken serious

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.620
- Hell yeah!
- That's right!

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.040
(Music)

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:39.820
- The only way out, is for us
to come together.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:40.940
- Excellent idea!

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:41.900
- Whooo!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.920
(Music)

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.600
There's more strength in a single unified message

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:57.020
(Music)

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:09.460
(Slow) - Mighty, we are ready to receive you.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.940
(Music)

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:19.000
(No audio) (End)

